      "markdown": "# EMS Splunk Ingest Pipeline (EMS-only view)\nCloudWatch Logs (300+ accts) \u2192 **Kinesis** \u2192 **Lambda (enrichment)** \u2192 **NLB/ALB \u2192 Splunk HF/Indexers (HEC)**\n\n_No AWS/Logs metrics from producer accounts; use EMS ingress + derived signals._"
    },
